{
  "_about": "What kind of outlet each news feed is (plan 15, Oct 22, 2026), read by build-outlet-directory.py. A feed not listed under kinds is a national outlet: a country's general news outlet. agency: a news agency (wire service), whose copy other outlets often run. international: a broadcaster or publisher whose audience is the world or a whole region. local: a city, region or community outlet. specialist: one subject (business, defence, science, shipping...). aggregator: mostly runs other outlets' reports. official: a government, central bank, court, UN or Red Cross press office or alert service. state: the outlet answers to a government (from the feed list's state-media label, plus the ones listed).",
